<title>NETHERLANDS: SCHUITEMA H1 NET UP 10.7 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>SCHUITEMA H1 NET UP 10.7 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMERSFOORT 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First 28 weeks of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.4  vs  20.2 </p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.82 vs   1.69</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    27.3  vs  24.9 </p>
<p>NOTE - Groceries wholesaler Schuitema said it expected to see a further</p>
<p>profit rise for the full 1997 year.</p>
<p>&quot;The expectation is that the profit rise of the first half</p>
<p>will also continue into the second half,&quot; Schuitema said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>    Financial gains			7.4  vs   6.4</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.3  vs  11.1</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
